		{"id":"node-080","type":"group","x":641,"y":893,"width":1334,"height":925,"label":"保護機制（2026-08-18～26，防崩潰/防不可行，✅=已納入生產預設）"},
		{"id":"node-070","type":"group","x":2957,"y":1038,"width":980,"height":780,"label":"研究方向（2026-08-03～11，✅=已納入生產預設）"},
		{"id":"node-002","type":"group","x":-20,"y":-260,"width":440,"height":620,"label":"初始化（優先序退回：Dirichlet→ML→Random）"},
		{"id":"node-003","type":"text","text":"**Random Init**\n（三者都關閉/失敗時的最終備援）","x":10,"y":-240,"width":380,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-010","type":"text","text":"## Stage 1: analytical_place()\nAdam 梯度下降 300 步\n+ MIB_ANCHOR_SNAP（訓練中引導）\n+ MIB_ANCHOR（輸出前對齊）","x":640,"y":-75,"width":380,"height":290,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-011","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2a: legalize()\n順序抽取 → 壓實 → cleanup\n⚡ FAST_CLEANUP (2.4×)","x":1220,"y":-30,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-004","type":"text","text":"**Dirichlet 調和延拓初始化**\n生產預設（取代舊 Jacobi）\n`ELECTRO_DIRICHLET_INIT=1`\nGraph Laplacian 封閉解\n全 100 案 Neutral 1.4018→1.3776 (-1.73%)","x":10,"y":-60,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-060","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2b: slice_pack()\nGuillotine 遞迴切割\n+ SLICE_ALIGN_PORTFOLIO\n兩種方向都保留成候選","x":1220,"y":260,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-005","type":"text","text":"**ML 暖啟動**\n`ELECTRO_ML_INIT=1`（生產預設）\nseeds>1 才使用","x":10,"y":215,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-001","type":"text","text":"# Electro Pipeline v22\n**生產預設** Neutral=1.2252, 100/100 合法\nREAL≈0.878–0.895(隨機器負載變動)","x":-18,"y":-544,"width":600,"height":185,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-031","type":"text","text":"⚡ **FAST_CLEANUP**\n真實 Total −12.2%\n快過中位數 43→95 案","x":1800,"y":-410,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-012","type":"text","text":"## Stage 3: soft_repair()\nboundary snap + wide-swap\ngrouping push-past\n✅ MIB 統一 + 補一輪 boundary snap\n    MIB_UNIFY / MIB_POST_SNAP\n✅ MIB_BOTH:統一前的版本\n    也一起送進候選池","x":1800,"y":-10,"width":380,"height":325,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-033","type":"text","text":"**已測不採用**\nSLICE_WALLS / BUDGET / ...","x":1800,"y":-220,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-020","type":"text","text":"**place-compact**\n`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`\n中心點新初始化 + 短版\nTOPK=3 (75% 省計算)","x":2085,"y":380,"width":360,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-050","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio 選擇\n每個候選都算 proxy cost，逐案挑最低者送出","x":2260,"y":870,"width":480,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-032","type":"text","text":"**MIB 候選分岔**\n✅ MIB_BOTH=1(新,生產預設)\n_finish 同時輸出「統一前 / 統一後」\n兩份都進池,proxy 逐案挑\n⛔ MIB_PORTFOLIO 改為預設關閉\n(UNIFY 開啟後它只產生重複品)","x":2265,"y":-410,"width":440,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-040","type":"text","text":"**Proxy Cost 排名**\nexp(2·V_rel)·(hpwl/ha + area/aa)\n錨點跟候選池無關","x":2310,"y":660,"width":380,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-021","type":"text","text":"**LP 位移最小化**\n`ELECTRO_LP_DISPLACEMENT=1`\nLP 式最小位移 legalize\n獨立額外候選","x":2535,"y":380,"width":360,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-081","type":"text","text":"**Fallback Ladder 重排 ✅ 已納入生產預設**\npush candidate 提到第一級嘗試\n原本要 3 級全部 fallback 才觸發，\n浪費 RT 又晚才救援\n重排後同時省 RT + 提升品質\n(2 個真實崩潰案例: cost 2.32/2.24→1.99/2.00,\nRT ~7s→4.7-4.8s)","x":1485,"y":960,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-083","type":"text","text":"**Push-Candidate 二次重疊驗證 ✅**\nlegalize() 後補 _overlap_pairs() 檢查\n沒清乾淨的候選整個作廢\n補上 legalize.py「保證零重疊」\n漏未排除的 preplaced-preplaced\n重疊洞","x":699,"y":980,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-084","type":"text","text":"**AREA GUARD 面積硬約束強制執行 ✅**\n|w·h−a|/a≤0.01，從「上游預算假設」\n改成「主動檢查 + 等比例縮放校正」\n2026-08-15 真實隱藏測資：10/100 不可行\n案例的 max_area_drift 100% 全部超標\n(10 對 10，無一例外)\n2026-08-26 用同尺寸訓練集驗證(40案，\nn=23/25/27/28/34/37/45/53/64/76)：\n現行生產碼 0 不可行，全部落在門檻下","x":795,"y":1393,"width":900,"height":354,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-071","type":"text","text":"**L-BFGS 打磨（負面）**\nfrac≥0.7 凍結所有 schedule\n3 個切換點全部更慢 (3.35-6.54×)\n品質也更差","x":2977,"y":1058,"width":450,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-072","type":"text","text":"**Per-RMAP 可行性（負面）**\n交替投影 + 擾動\n20 案 V_rel 變差 28.2%\n慢 33 倍，15 輪內未收斂","x":3467,"y":1058,"width":450,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-073","type":"text","text":"**ADMM 邊界（負面）**\n有號殘差增廣拉格朗日\n20 案 Neutral 變差 8.1%\nVgrp/Vmib/Vbnd 全部變差","x":2977,"y":1288,"width":450,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-074","type":"text","text":"**對偶上升 boundary ✅ 已納入生產預設**\nELECTRO_DUAL_ASCENT_BND=1 K=40\n（v19無此程式碼，之前設了無聲失效）\n獨立量測：Neutral 1.3642→1.3612, Vbnd 164→133","x":3467,"y":1288,"width":450,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-075","type":"text","text":"**合法化長寬比彈性 ✅ 已納入生產預設**\nlegalize_qinfer_reshape，8/11移植v19→v20\n跟對偶上升疊加背靠背：Neutral 1.3612→1.3260(-2.6%)\nREAL 1.0005→0.9987（不降反升），Vgrp/Vbnd↓ Vmib+16%","x":2977,"y":1558,"width":940,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-082","type":"text","text":"**place() 輸出 NaN 防護 ✅**\nelectro_parallel.py\nplace() 輸出後立即 isfinite() 檢查\n不通過就直接丟棄該候選\n阻斷 NaN 往下游 legalize 傳染","x":430,"y":393,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"}
